      "greedy_continuation": " generally known, that it is not necessary to enter into particulars.\n\nThe first step in the acquisition of a wife is to be a good husband. The first step in the acquisition of a wife is to be a good husband.\n\nThe first step in the acquisition of a wife is",
      "samples": [
        " fully established, that it is not difficult to convince a stranger, that if he would but choose his wife from the crowd, all others will be preferred by the eye and fancy before the sober judgment of the woman's own heart.\n\nTo men this principle is so deeply imbedded, that",
