      "greedy_continuation": " very pleasant thing to do, and I have often thought that I should like to do it again. I have been in the habit of going to the sea, and I have been in the habit of going to the land. I have been in the habit of going to the land, and I have",
      "samples": [
        " curious thing, this fancy. We all of us have much to occupy our minds, and I had none of my own.\n\nI left my cabin and walked along the deck; and I was not long in discovering that in the curious world of watery places, there is a great deal of",
        " dull business, you see, and a bad kind of travel, to go about continually and not to see anything new or interesting to people on shore. I thought I might plant a few flowers or make a few pretty snuff-boxes, and either go to Dublin or to the Continent, and",
        " good way to get money, and water has always been dear to me; so, to the end of my voyage, I have always carried a skin of it in my pocket, though I have seldom enough to last me through a single day.\n\nNow, as I began the business of my"
      ],
