      "greedy_continuation": " didn't tell, and there was things which he did tell, and there was things which he didn't tell, and there was things which he did tell, and there was things which he didn't tell, and there was things which he did tell, and there was things which he didn't tell",
      "samples": [
        "'d been told and there was things that he'd seen and done. Your father has told you the things he saw, too. And you know, without a shadow of doubt, that you don't have to tell them to me. I couldn't guess them, or I couldn't want to.",
        " said—and I think he had a reason for saying—that was not true; and some of it was not fair; and some of it was not just. People have done things which have hurt people, and I don't say that I have done them as well as he has. I do",
        " described that was true, and things which he was mistaken about; but the truth of the matter was he didn't know himself. It was his own fault, and he must own up to it, and ask God to forgive him. I'm used to not knowing myself. You look at me,"
      ],
