      "greedy_continuation": " was my own. I had been a long time in the house, and I had not yet been able to get the door open. I had been obliged to use the key, and it was now in my pocket. I had been in the house a long time, and I had not yet been",
      "samples": [
        " now acknowledged my presence. The fire, though small, was burning brightly, and I worked feverishly with my brush, while I gazed anxiously upward toward the sky to see if any signs of God could be seen. I threw my hand into the air and gave a silent prayer for the safety of",
        " had thus far lain cold in my hands. As I mounted the platform, my heart swelled within me as though, for the first time, I had set my foot on the threshold of the greatest happiness which could befall me; and the first moment that I gazed through the glass, I",
        " was still my heart. I looked at the little heap of ashes; and I was filled with a sudden reverence that seemed to differ from that which I had ever felt before.\n\n\"I was indeed in a state of profound dejection; but I was astonished to behold my soul revive within"
      ],
