      "greedy_continuation": "\n\nSauce (1 Cup)\n\n1/2 Cup Brown Sauce\n\n1/2 Cup Vegetable Stock\n\n1/2 Cup Milk\n\n1/2 Cup Water\n\n1/2 Cup Vegetable Oil\n\n1/2 Cup Brown Sugar\n\n1",
      "samples": [
        " Light and creamy. Medium to high heat. You’ll need a large skillet that holds at least 4 lbs. of meat (cut in half from neck to shoulder, remove bone, and slice. Brown the shoulder and side of the meat in a hot skillet until lightly browned, then spoon out",
