      "greedy_continuation": ", where the enemy was driven back with heavy loss.\n\nThe enemy's fire was now very heavy, and the men were ordered to retire. The enemy was now in possession of the whole front, and the attack was renewed. The enemy was now in possession of the whole front, and the",
      "samples": [
        ", the objective of which was to capture the trench with its bayonets. On the right of the 155th Battalion, where the first objective was the junction of the railway and side-trench, the attack was handled with great efficiency by Headquarter Company, and all the while the company medical",
        ", and the second wave of British troops was advancing beyond. The officers were more excited than the men and wanted to attack. However, the rank and file seemed to want to attack their own trenches. Before our troops could come to their assistance the Germans had thrown a strong screen of barbed wire across",
        " Brigade in the 1st Division sector, in which the counter-attacking infantry of the 2nd Division were severely handicapped by the presence of our own troops, and the line was eventually established by these troops alone.\n\nThe fighting in our sector was very severe, and it must be admitted"
      ],
