      "greedy_continuation": " beans.\n\nThe food was always hot, and the coffee was always hot.\n\nThe food was always hot, and the coffee was always hot.\n\nThe food was always hot, and the coffee was always hot.\n\nThe food was always hot, and the coffee was always",
      "samples": [
        " beans. Elated with the food, the bigehoo was on the verge of a genuine eatin' frenzy.\n\nAfter about ten minutes of eating, the boys would be just as excited as little girls collected in a lotto lottery. Many would be raiding the cabinets in",
        " beans.\"\n\n\"No need, doctor, to tell me what to eat. I know how to take care of myself. Let me pray for you.\"\n\nHe helped me to my room and went away.\n\nI went to bed quickly, and slept soundly.\n\n##",
        " beans. Dinner then followed a hard day's work or the morning work. A penny for each extra piece of wood, coal, or iron required to make a fire. Dinner was a nice, warm meal and provided a rest for the weary sleeper. Extra food was doled out for"
