      "greedy_continuation": " This pattern is worked in the round.\n\n**Row 1:** K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K 2, K",
      "samples": [
        " This is the closest to the pattern piece you can get, and is the pattern you will be using. The on button and the loop from the other side of the cap are not shown in this pattern.\n\n## MEASURING SCARF\n\nWe are used to working with fabric",
        " The same construction as for the folded skirt. [Illustration: uncaptioned] REST Friday: Use the doubled piece of cable to make the bottom seam. After it is sewn across the top of the skirt, sew up the side seams, and sew up the back seam. [Illustration:",
