      "greedy_continuation": " but with days of struggle.\n\nLook back in your own lives, see what the things are that you are proudest of as you look back, and you will in almost every case and on almost every occasion find that those memories of pride are associated, not with days of ease, but with",
      "samples": [
        " but with duties.\n\n'You know, I'm proud of the fact that my parents were not only literate, but they always knew how to behave themselves. And I suppose you can be anything you want to be, but you have to be able to behave yourself.\n\nAnd you",
        " but with days of struggle.\n\nThe Christian’s pride of faith is associated with the experience of pain and persecution. The Christian’s pride of faith is associated with sharing Christ and performing his work. The Christian’s pride of faith is associated with the experience of persecution, and the following",
        " but of days of struggle and then days of deep grief and then days of relief.\n\nI love you, dear, my dear, my dear, my dear.\n\nThen, in the most tender and undying and loving way, I say to you, “O my God, I"
