      "greedy_continuation": " beginning, a child of the world, and I have grown up to be a man. I have seen the world, and I have seen the world's ways. I have seen the world's ways, and I have seen the world's ways. I have seen the world's ways, and I",
      "samples": [
        " beginning, as I am. I have not changed. Even if I had, you would not care. What do you want from me, then? The mask is off, and the whimpering girl is revealed. I am not a monster, I told you. I do not prevent what others desire",
        " end, but a guest in your house. Those who can speak the truth to reproach me for it are not the ones I have wronged. Those who have been rightly silent are not the ones I have wronged. Are you not correct, Rosanna, that everyone has been wronged?",
        " end, the one who got away with it. I don't know why. It must be that I am not as ordinary as they are. And yet, I know it is I who stole a soul. I stole the soul of a man, and I _was_ the man. I have"
      ],
