      "greedy_continuation": " roots.\n\nThe plant absorbs water from the air and transports it to its leaves.\n\nThe leaves are the main part of the plant that absorbs water.\n\nThe leaves are the main part of the plant that transports water to the roots.\n\nThe roots are",
