      "greedy_continuation": " The heart is the pump: it is the vessel that pushes blood through the body. The valves are the valves: they are the valves that keep the blood flowing in the right direction. The valves are the valves that keep the blood flowing in the right direction. The valves are the valves that keep the",
      "samples": [
        " First the flow of blood must be halted in each valve before it can start again. First the groove at the top of a heart valve is depressed until it is halfway open, then the other groove is turned up so that the flow is stopped. The valves are clogged by clots of blood and",
        " The pigeonhole system is a VAAP system: all children are counted as having just one valve. The middle of each valve is a number, which is represented by the most common symbol (5 in this case), and the end of each valve is the most uncommon symbol (0, not counting",
        " The left ventricle is the original heart, the right ventricle is the new heart. The valves are a consequence of the rhythm of the heart and are necessary to preserve it. The left side has one valve, the right side has two. The one in the left ventricle forces the blood in the right ventricle"
      ],
