      "greedy_continuation": " The first step is the division of the number by the number of children, which is the same as the division of the number by the number of steps. The second step is the division of the number by the number of steps, which is the same as the division of the number by the number of",
      "samples": [
        " When the constant, the root of the problem, is subtracted from 1, the problem is solved: one day in the week-day quarter.\n\nTask: Find the largest prime factor of the number 629, write the prime factors in order and the factors in ascending order.\nAnswer:",
        " The devil being an evil, the curse cannot be broken by good deeds or bounties. When he is crossed he appears as a blind dog, which fixes his own image, and his words of blessing lack strength and meaning. When a child asked for a second answer, the person answering gave the",
        " To the curse that came upon the princess, the money that the rascals had found upon the ground caused the guy who found it to be cursed: when the troubadour heard the story, he was not surprised that the princess' head was chopped off, but he was surprised that the money"
      ],
