      "greedy_continuation": " A mathematical notation is a system of symbols that can be used to represent numbers, and the symbols are arranged in a way that makes it easy to read and write. The symbols are arranged in a way that makes it easy to read and write, but the symbols are not arranged in a way that makes",
      "samples": [
        " Teachers have one long note and one short note in each case they make to explain that particular problem. The long note is for the whole class, the short one for each student, and the instructor can read the notes to herself. If the note is long enough for deaf children, she can sign or",
        " Invent a mathematical symbol that does not exist today for the equality or inequality of two quantities or two sets of objects, but has in the past been used by physicists. The idea of a two-word symbol has another advantage: it is much easier to remember than a longer symbol, and also",
        " A teacher blows through a note-sheet by hand, which is thought to be in a different direction to the path the wind takes. The tip of the sheet is a message: CANCER, FIGURE A, HUNTED DOOR, STRAIGHT TRACK, SOUTHER"
      ],
