      "greedy_continuation": " architect.\n\nA person who designs buildings is called an architect.\n\nA person who designs buildings is called an architect.\n\nA person who designs buildings is called an architect.\n\nA person who designs buildings is called an architect.\n\nA person who designs buildings is called an",
