      "greedy_continuation": " Paris, France. It is the tallest structure in the world.\n\nThe Eiffel Tower is a landmark in Paris, France.\n\nThe Eiffel Tower is a landmark in Paris, France.\n\nThe Eiffel Tower is a landmark in Paris, France.\n",
      "samples": [
        " Paris in France. It is a tourist attraction and a monument of the 19th and 20th centuries. It is constructed from iron and steel and is the second tallest tourist attraction in the world (after the Empire State Building). The Paris skyline is dominated by two other monuments, the Tour E",
        " Paris. Many people compare it to the Statue of Liberty.\n\nThe Eiffel Tower is made of reinforced concrete, which is very strong. The statue of Liberty is made of clay, which is very weak.\n\nIn the eighteenth century, the Eiffel Tower was built to",
        " Paris.\n\nThe most famous French novel is The Little Prince.\n\nEskimos spend 12,000 years in the ice without a single winter.\n\nThe world's longest river is the Nile.\n\nDutch cheese is the tastiest cheese in the world.\n\nThe Roman"
