        }
      ],
      "greedy_continuation": " A house with a roof that is not a roof, a floor that is not a floor, and a wall that is not a wall. The roof is a flat, flat roof, the floor is a flat, flat floor, and the wall is a flat, flat wall. The roof is a",
      "samples": [
        " A well-trenched feature that everyone can admire, but only a few really understand. The solution is an arrangement of wood panels that have been joined at the back to hold the house together. A single panel at the front can be pulled back far enough to let a window in or out. The",
        " Fill the house with little squares of brick on the outside and clap them along the vertical walls to prevent the drift of water. The squares are glued on the exterior in places where they touch other squares and in others where they are stuck to the outside. At any time, a square might be",
        " A self-contained wall separates the living room from the kitchen. The light comes in through a window or a shower, but the draught is from a recessed thermos or a water tap. The kitchen can air-condition the living room and the side rooms, so that the home feels clean"
      ],
      "manipulation": {}
