      "greedy_continuation": " The first step is to identify the supply-chain function that the mythic power corresponds to. The mythic power of Hermes is the ability to move things from one place to another, so the first step is to identify the function that the mythic power corresponds to. The mythic power of",
      "samples": [
        " Each of the functions of the network is replicated in the myth. The shipment: the Hermes knows where to find a storage place for a particular quantity of a given material; the storage: the Hermes knows where to find a collection of components; the customs: the Hermes knows how to slip",
        " Hermes' chief area of expertise is navigation, the art of finding the shortest path between two points in the shortest time. Knowing where the fastest route lies would make it possible to find someone who is then at his destination and return at leisure, as if he had finished the journey on foot. The",
        " The delivery artist is the person who first collects the packages, or, in the case of the mythic Hermes, the messenger who first finds the package and then transfers it to his hand. The network is a global supply chain, or a division of it, involving 3-6 different trades."
      ],
      "manipulation": {
        "l4_both_domains": false,
        "l4_n_sentences": 2
      }
