      "greedy_continuation": " eggs.\n\nThe main ingredient of an omelette is eggs.\n\nThe main ingredient of an omelette is eggs.\n\nThe main ingredient of an omelette is eggs.\n\nThe main ingredient of an omelette is eggs.\n\nThe main ingredient of",
