        " spinach.\n\nThe main ingredient of a salad is lettuce.\n\nThe main ingredient of a sandwich is mayonnaise.\n\nHow many octahedrons are in a cube?\n\nThe number of people in this room is twelve.\n\nA round is an icosahedron",
