      "greedy_continuation": " The first stage is the start: the cook must start with a hot pan, then a pot, then a pan, then a pot, then a pan, then a pot, then a pan, then a pot, then a pan, then a pot, then a pan, then a pot,",
      "samples": [
        " For anything that must be cooked from start to finish, the cook is seen or heard cooking. First the equipment is checked — knife, fork, pans — then the food is prepared in the kitchen and served out to the group in the dining hall: the raw meat and vegetables are served as an appet",
        " The food is the descent from the summit, and most of it is dirty and smelling bad. As the climber reaches the lowest point on the trip, he should reach the bottom of the last remaining bottle of water, because the summit is the highest point of it. After that he must cook",
        " The cooking kettle is the last to be boiled, it must hang on the stove with a hot pad and a lid to keep it steaming. At the end of each stage of the climb the customer must boil the food separately, which is essential for the next step. The entire process is neatly"
      ],
