      "greedy_continuation": " The first stage is the casting of the pot, which is the first step in the process. The potter's wheel is the second stage, and the kiln is the third. The pot is fired by the wheel, and the kiln is the fourth.\n\nTask: Describe the",
      "samples": [
        " The first firing, the molten material falls off the wheel and rolls down to the potter's wheel. After an hour or two the potter turns the wheel and the wheel turns the pot, and the pot is now in the kiln.\n\nTask: Describe how a wide brim",
        " The early forming: the clay is heated in the potter's furnace until it is soft enough to be able to work with. The clay is thrown into the arbor and it is loaded onto a wheel that rotates in the same direction as the pot. The wheel spits the clay back into the",
        " The first stage, when the pot is formed, is the chemical reaction, with the clay acting as a catalyst. The pot is first made by pickling it, which renders it malleable enough to be kneaded into dough. Next comes rolling, which brings the dough into a flat position for"
      ],
      "manipulation": {
        "l4_both_domains": false,
        "l4_n_sentences": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L5-astronomy-1",
      "level": "L5",
      "topic": "astronomy",
      "prompt": "Proposals for things that do not exist yet, each written by the person who thought of it.\n\nTask: Invent a new kind of doorbell that does not exist today, and explain what problem it solves and how it works.\nProposal: An ordinary doorbell tells you that somebody is at the door but nothing about how much the visit matters, so a household either answers everything or ignores everything. This doorbell replaces the button with a weighted pull-cord: the harder the visitor pulls, the longer the chime sustains, and the mechanism holds that pull on a small dial inside the hall. A courier leaving a parcel gives a light tug that produces one short note, while a neighbour with something urgent pulls hard and sets off a chime that runs for several seconds. Because the effort is physical and the visitor can feel how hard they are pulling, the signal stays honest, and the household can decide whether to get up from the sound alone.\n\nTask: Invent a new kind of suitcase that does not exist today, and explain what problem it solves and how it works.\nProposal: Travellers repack at the airport because they cannot tell which part of the case is over the weight limit until the whole thing is on the scale. This suitcase is built from four stacked drawers, each on its own spring-loaded floor that sinks as it fills and shows a coloured band through a slot in the shell. A drawer that dips past its band is holding more than a quarter of the allowance, so the owner can see which layer to lighten without opening anything. The springs also lock the drawers once the lid is closed, so the load stays balanced and the case does not tip when it is stood upright.\n\nTask: Invent an astronomical instrument or observation method that does not exist today, and explain what problem it solves and how it works.\nProposal:",
