      "greedy_continuation": " A telescope is a device that can see the sky, but it is not a telescope that can see the sky. It is a device that can see the sky, but it is not a telescope that can see the sky. It is a device that can see the sky, but it is not a",
      "samples": [
        " A large telescope determines where a star is located on the sky by measuring the speed of light with a network of mirrors, and comparing it with the speed of light behind the mirrors. The biggest advantage of this method is that it is cheap to build.\n\nTask: Invent a way of making",
        " Instead of looking at the sky through a telescope, a fly in the air could take off a monitor, which then sent sound and image to a decoders that would show all the planets in the sky. This would be a more sensitive and less cluttered observer than the one accustomed to seeing the",
        " The telescope is a small device that its owner can point at an object and point at the moon and count the return time. It is the most precise and accurate telescope since the day it was invented, and it costs less than the oil for the rock that it uses. The instrument is a mechanical tracking"
