      "greedy_continuation": " Deep-sea creatures are hard to study because they are so small and hard to see. The only way to study them is to dive, and the only way to dive is to go to the bottom of the sea. This is a new kind of diving suit that is made from a flexible material that",
      "samples": [
        " If a deep-sea animal is king of the sea then there is some sea where its true form can be seen. Observation is difficult because there are many depths and the sea is vast, but there is a place where deep-sea creatures are rare enough not to disturb the local ecosystem, so",
        " Scientists believe that most animals on Earth are living in the deep sea, but the scientific definitions of marine life are so vague that nobody knows how many animals there are. The inventor of the deep-sea diving suit explains that it is impossible to tell whether a creature is a fish or a non-fish",
        " Any deep-sea creature needs to breathe, so it needs to be able to keep itself afloat. One way to achieve this is to attach a number of hard floats to the creature’s face, each with a thin spring that makes it go under the water without breaking the surface. The spring"
      ],
      "manipulation": {}
    },
