      "greedy_continuation": "\nThe piano is a thing of beauty,\nBut it is a thing of sorrow,\nFor it is a thing of time.\n\nInstruction: Write a two-line rhyming couplet about a piano.\nPiece:\nThe piano is a thing of beauty,\n",
      "samples": [
        "\nThe musician must play his song,\nBut still the piano’s time won’t stay.\n\nInstruction: Write a two-line rhyming couplet about a bicycle.\nPiece:\nThe bicycle pedals are in the saddle,\nAnd ride the town of",
        "\nThe piano plays its own tune,\nBut the tune is tinny and won't get old.\n\nInstruction: Write a two-line rhyming couplet about a zodiac sign.\nPiece:\nThe zodiac signs are just as they are,\n",
        "\nThe piano does not allow a mistake,\nAnd must keep up the match to the tune.\n\nInstruction: Write a two-line rhyming couplet about a ghost.\nPiece:\nA ghost doesn't stop to develop a plan,\nUntil the living person calls"
      ],
