      "greedy_continuation": " The first stage is the introduction, when the first voice is heard. The second is the introduction of the second voice, and so on. The third stage is the introduction of the third voice, and so on. The fourth stage is the introduction of the fourth voice, and so on. The fifth",
      "samples": [
        " The round is the melody, and if it is in a variation it repeats, for the same reason that a single note always repeats, and because every melodic variation has the same tuning, each part of the pattern is drawn the same way. It goes from almost done to done, and then,",
        " Each part of the outbreak spreads by its own rhythm, a melody that lines up with the notes of the song, and the patterns of the voice formation, as first the intonations are brought in and then the melody is heard with its individual notes.\n\nTask: Describe a time-",
        " Each part of the round is a simple repeated melody: 4 bars in each of the 6 voices, and 3 bars for each of the 5 others. The chorus is a single melody, the verses are the same melody, conducted by the same player, and the final bars are all the same melody."
      ],
