      "greedy_continuation": " A concert is a series of songs, usually with a soloist, that is played in a fixed order. The soloist is usually a soloist, but sometimes a group of singers or a soloist and a group of musicians. The soloist is usually a soloist, but sometimes a group",
      "samples": [
        " Concussion is made by shaking a glass up and down in rapid succession in a dark room. In a series of experiments, people have found that the sound of the glass can produce a powerful and long-lasting effect, and that they can remember the impact for days if they are shown a record",
        " A symphony orchestra starts a piece, but the music is not available until the players are ready. Each player will take a turn saying when she is ready to start. She has to announce her arrival before she does anything else, so that the orchestra knows when she has the piece, and can then",
        " A village has performances every weekday at noon. There is a lead singer and several players, all of whom are soloists, and they all play their own instruments and lead their own ensembles. There is also a choir, a band, a string quartet, and a large brass section. The"
