      "greedy_continuation": " a white square on the top row and a black square on the bottom row.\n\nA chessboard is a two-dimensional array of squares.\n\nA chessboard is a two-dimensional array of squares.\n\nA chessboard is a two-dimensional array of squares.\n\n",
